# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — REDDOX CLIPORA AI

## PROJECT IDENTITY

Build a complete, professional, production-structured AI video clipping and editing SaaS platform named **REDDOX Clipora AI**.

The application must be a fully functional AI-powered video clipping platform that enables users to upload long-form videos or submit supported video URLs, automatically identify engaging moments, generate short-form clips, customize captions, edit the clips manually, and export finished videos.

This must be a real working application, not a static UI prototype.

The platform should deliver a premium experience comparable in quality and usability to professional products such as OpusClip, Vizard and VEED, while maintaining its own original identity, interface, architecture and features.

The entire project must be developed using Google AI Studio Build Mode.

